# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These directories are scratch/build output and must never be tracked again.
# Nearly 5.5 GB of publish trees, installers, .dmg/.zip/.apk output, crash hang
# dumps and agent session logs had accumulated here because the narrow rules
# below/above were added *after* the files were already committed -- and
# gitignore never applies to already-tracked files. The broad rules win now.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/tmp/
/artifacts/
/LeikwanBridge.Desktop/tests/**/TestResults/
dsh-session-*/
